function directorEase(q,mode='smooth'){q=clamp(q);return mode==='linear'?q:mode==='in'?q*q:mode==='out'?1-(1-q)**3:mode==='snap'?+(q>=1):q*q*(3-2*q)}
function depotAnimatedSettings(age,input){const out={...input};for(const [key,track]of Object.entries(input.depotTracks||{})){if(!track.length)continue;const keys=track.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.at-b.at);if(age<=keys[0].at){out[key]=keys[0].value;continue}if(age>=keys.at(-1).at){out[key]=keys.at(-1).value;continue}for(let i=1;i<keys.length;i++)if(age<=keys[i].at){const a=keys[i-1],b=keys[i],q=directorEase((age-a.at)/(b.at-a.at),input.depotTrackEase?.[key]);out[key]=typeof a.value==='number'?a.value+(b.value-a.value)*q:a.value;break}}return out}
